{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":15,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":865,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914076,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1464613053,"LastPoster":{"Id":270078,"Name":"Torifire","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270078.jpg?_r=1468642609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1914076,"PostDate":1464613053,"PostContent":"Hello beautiful brides! I am brand new and TERRIFIED! We still don't have a set guest list (not e...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmillerick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464609188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmillerick","Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f37ce046490521da685d1756fda1bdd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, times, serif;\"&gt;Hello beautiful brides!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, times, serif;\"&gt;I am brand new and TERRIFIED! We still don&#039;t have a set guest list (not even the \"I know you won&#039;t come but here&#039;s an invite anyway\" complimentary invites), we do have a set budget and that&#039;s it. I need to find a resort or location that does DW (I&#039;m open to all locations in Mexico and the Caribbean, the majority of the guest will be coming from the east coast) and go from there. &amp;nbsp;At this point I&#039;d love any suggestions for resorts. I&#039;ve looked at&amp;nbsp;Playacar Palace Spa Resort, any thoughts?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, times, serif;\"&gt;thank you for any help! and congrats to everyone!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914076,"PostDate":1464613053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Hello beautiful brides!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">I am brand new and TERRIFIED! We still don't have a set guest list (not even the \"I know you won't come but here's an invite anyway\" complimentary invites), we do have a set budget and that's it. I need to find a resort or location that does DW (I'm open to all locations in Mexico and the Caribbean, the majority of the guest will be coming from the east coast) and go from there. \u00a0At this point I'd love any suggestions for resorts. I've looked at\u00a0Playacar Palace Spa Resort, any thoughts?<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">thank you for any help! and congrats to everyone!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmillerick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464609188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmillerick","Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.251","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"556031fc07c844142139f4e03bba3660","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi at @[member=\"bmillerick\"] and welcome to the BDW forums! You&#039;ve certainly come to the right place and congrats on your upcoming wedding. Searching around here on this community will help you feel less terrified as you&#039;ll get most of the answers you&#039;re looking for!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your choice for Mexico and the Caribbean is an awesome one! The \"Riviera Maya\" Mexico is a spectacular place to hold a destination wedding and there are so many resorts, beach clubs, etc situated so beautifully on the Caribbean sea for you to have a perfect wedding day! &amp;nbsp;Playacar Palace is gorgeous and there are so many more options up and down the coast from Cancun to Tulum. In fact, I found a great article about some of the best destinations in this area, maybe it will help you with ideas and have a good place to start! For the article click &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.oyster.com\/riviera-maya\/hotels\/roundups\/best-hotels-for-destination-weddings-in-riviera-maya\/&#039;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of luck planning and if you have any questions, we are a makeup artist\/hair stylist wedding vendor in this area, located in Playa del Carmen and can provide you with many recommendations for your wedding planning. if we can be of help let us know. Happy destination wedding planning! Enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914077,"PostDate":1464614772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi at @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> and welcome to the BDW forums! You've certainly come to the right place and congrats on your upcoming wedding. Searching around here on this community will help you feel less terrified as you'll get most of the answers you're looking for!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your choice for Mexico and the Caribbean is an awesome one! The \"Riviera Maya\" Mexico is a spectacular place to hold a destination wedding and there are so many resorts, beach clubs, etc situated so beautifully on the Caribbean sea for you to have a perfect wedding day! \u00a0Playacar Palace is gorgeous and there are so many more options up and down the coast from Cancun to Tulum. In fact, I found a great article about some of the best destinations in this area, maybe it will help you with ideas and have a good place to start! For the article click <a href='https:\/\/www.oyster.com\/riviera-maya\/hotels\/roundups\/best-hotels-for-destination-weddings-in-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of luck planning and if you have any questions, we are a makeup artist\/hair stylist wedding vendor in this area, located in Playa del Carmen and can provide you with many recommendations for your wedding planning. if we can be of help let us know. Happy destination wedding planning! Enjoy!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Dena DaSilva<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Online Concierge<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">US (+1) 713 589 4558<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">MX (+52) 984 803 2816<br>\nconcierge@stylingtrio.com<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Facebook: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">facebook\/stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Twitter:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Instagram:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Pinterest: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.pinterest.com\/stylingtrio<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/hapv1CMGpXYv2FEz6ZYtPWd2Y_yEKx8fi8QHoF6qa6giBtQe5Sq7Qu37JOO6-9XwSHFc1cI6Ke5Y2N3x9Ue9=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/stylingtrio.com\/Firmas\/Styling.jpg\" alt=\"Styling.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0","Email":"social@stylingtrio.com","IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1462465132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286883.jpg?_r=1469141104","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StylingTrio","Id":286883,"Name":"StylingTrio","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.38.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba3b5a0096dc8b6ff60d7df7fbe750d7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"bmillerick\" post=\"1914076\" timestamp=\"1464627453\"]\n[size=4][font=&#039;times new roman&#039;]Hello beautiful brides![\/font][\/size]\n[size=4][font=&#039;times new roman&#039;]I am brand new and TERRIFIED! We still don&#039;t have a set guest list (not even the \"I know you won&#039;t come but here&#039;s an invite anyway\" complimentary invites), we do have a set budget and that&#039;s it. I need to find a resort or location that does DW (I&#039;m open to all locations in Mexico and the Caribbean, the majority of the guest will be coming from the east coast) and go from there.  At this point I&#039;d love any suggestions for resorts. I&#039;ve looked at Playacar Palace Spa Resort, any thoughts?[\/font][\/size]\n[size=4][font=&#039;times new roman&#039;]thank you for any help! and congrats to everyone![\/font][\/size][\/quote]@[member=\"bmillerick\"] its only normal to feel terrified, let me assure you dont worry everything is going to turn out way more than you are imagining.\n\nMy advice first sit down with fiance and figure out the important things you want to see happen around your wedding, also some questions you might ask yourself to help go in the right direction.\nDo you thing you will need family friendly resorts?\nOr only adults? must the resort be small or bigger?\nDo want to have the ceremony on the beach or rooftop terrace? \n\nOnce you have some basic draft of your vision. get in touch with a Travel agent who specializes in DW.  They usually can help you narrow down your options. \n\nI see you looked at the playacar palace, have you looked at the other palaces as well? \n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914082,"PostDate":1464649508,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>bmillerick, on 30 May 2016 - 12:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Hello beautiful brides!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">I am brand new and TERRIFIED! We still don't have a set guest list (not even the \"I know you won't come but here's an invite anyway\" complimentary invites), we do have a set budget and that's it. I need to find a resort or location that does DW (I'm open to all locations in Mexico and the Caribbean, the majority of the guest will be coming from the east coast) and go from there. \u00a0At this point I'd love any suggestions for resorts. I've looked at\u00a0Playacar Palace Spa Resort, any thoughts?<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">thank you for any help! and congrats to everyone!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> its only normal to feel terrified, let me assure you dont worry everything is going to turn out way more than you are imagining.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My advice first sit down with fiance and figure out the important things you want to see happen around your wedding, also some questions you might ask yourself to help go in the right direction.<\/p>\n<p>Do you thing you will need family friendly resorts?<\/p>\n<p>Or only adults? must the resort be small or bigger?<\/p>\n<p>Do want to have the ceremony on the beach or rooftop terrace?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Once you have some basic draft of your vision. get in touch with a Travel agent who specializes in DW. \u00a0They usually can help you narrow down your options.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see you looked at the playacar palace, have you looked at the other palaces as well?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8b4d4b213078cda9559769f16a37de5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"bmillerick\"] Congrats on your upcoming wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Picking your resort is the hardest part of your planning I think. There are just so many options out there! But not every option works for every bride and groom. Do you know what time of year you want to get married? Your budget and that of your guests, can be drastically affected just by that. As Joyce mentioned, do you want family friendly or adults only? Have you got a vision of what you want your wedding to be?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Definitely get in touch with a destination wedding travel agent. They can help you work within your budget, look at your wants and don&#039;t wants and work with you to pick a resort that is going to fit with what you have in mind. The owner of this site, Wright Travel, are destination wedding specialists and I&#039;m sure they would be able to help you put ideas together that will help you make your decision. The other thing is, depending on the resort you choose, you might be entitled to some perks from the resort that you wouldn&#039;t event know about but a good TA would! Sometimes they will offer free events, or resort credits that your guests can also make use of. Every resort is different in what they offer and what they include so the help of a qualified TA will be invaluable. Then once that decision is made and you start inviting your guests, the TA will be able to be there and answer all of your guests&#039; travel questions and leave you free to concentrate on wedding planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Once you have your resort and can apply for a date for your wedding, that&#039;s half the battle right there. Then you can start on the fun stuff and putting all of your other details together. You can contact Wright Travel through this site.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914142,"PostDate":1464867414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> Congrats on your upcoming wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Picking your resort is the hardest part of your planning I think. There are just so many options out there! But not every option works for every bride and groom. Do you know what time of year you want to get married? Your budget and that of your guests, can be drastically affected just by that. As Joyce mentioned, do you want family friendly or adults only? Have you got a vision of what you want your wedding to be?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Definitely get in touch with a destination wedding travel agent. They can help you work within your budget, look at your wants and don't wants and work with you to pick a resort that is going to fit with what you have in mind. The owner of this site, Wright Travel, are destination wedding specialists and I'm sure they would be able to help you put ideas together that will help you make your decision. The other thing is, depending on the resort you choose, you might be entitled to some perks from the resort that you wouldn't event know about but a good TA would! Sometimes they will offer free events, or resort credits that your guests can also make use of. Every resort is different in what they offer and what they include so the help of a qualified TA will be invaluable. Then once that decision is made and you start inviting your guests, the TA will be able to be there and answer all of your guests' travel questions and leave you free to concentrate on wedding planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Once you have your resort and can apply for a date for your wedding, that's half the battle right there. Then you can start on the fun stuff and putting all of your other details together. You can contact Wright Travel through this site.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 02 June 2016 - 12:50 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1464871831,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0810fdc159dfb79b6f8afa9e4fb8a7c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community bmillerick and Congrats on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding!!! Such an exciting time in your life, no wonder you&#039;re feeling strongly about what&#039;s ahead!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;However as you can see from the answers you&#039;ve received already, there are great resources here to help with your planning questions, so...big Exhale.....it&#039;s all going to work out spectacular!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To see some of the beautiful resort choices in the popular Mayan Riviera region check out our blog posts that show what kind of a backdrop they&#039;ll make for your wedding photos: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Resorts&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - ENJOY!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(psst....we&#039;ve got your back! )&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_8529f3892e7b4334be515932cc21c56e.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_8529f3892e7b4334be515932cc21c56e.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_8529f3892e7b4334be515932cc21c56e.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914144,"PostDate":1464871725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community bmillerick and Congrats on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding!!! Such an exciting time in your life, no wonder you're feeling strongly about what's ahead!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However as you can see from the answers you've received already, there are great resources here to help with your planning questions, so...big Exhale.....it's all going to work out spectacular!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To see some of the beautiful resort choices in the popular Mayan Riviera region check out our blog posts that show what kind of a backdrop they'll make for your wedding photos: <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Resorts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - ENJOY!!!<\/p>\n<p>Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>(psst....we've got your back! )<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_8529f3892e7b4334be515932cc21c56e.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_8529f3892e7b4334be515932cc21c56e.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_8529f3892e7b4334be515932cc21c56e.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.127.211.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"952750e2837a6d19ba37768e5090bcfa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bmillerick\"] Hi! Welcome and congrats! A budget is a good place to start!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914159,"PostDate":1464897673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> Hi! Welcome and congrats! A budget is a good place to start!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407859786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.202.203.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"27840c47d39c001612d5b06dc29ed26d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"bmillerick\"] and welcome! I think speaking with a travel agent should be the first step. They are very knowledgeable about the resorts and can steer you in a good direction based on what you are looking for in a location.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914216,"PostDate":1465227006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> and welcome! I think speaking with a travel agent should be the first step. They are very knowledgeable about the resorts and can steer you in a good direction based on what you are looking for in a location.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.212.90.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08f86153532ba891959d43a85f0143a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@tiffanyt&amp;nbsp;@Mangosong@acw271011@dreamweddings thanks! I&#039;ve been in contact with a TA, she&#039;s amazing and has been so helpful! We have our own budget (also terrifying) but I&#039;m concerned what a good budget would be to set for my guests. I have a range from early 20s to late 60s and every type of income so I&#039;m trying to figure out the best median number for my guests for 3 or 4 nights, any suggestions?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914217,"PostDate":1465228664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@tiffanyt\u00a0@Mangosong@acw271011@dreamweddings thanks! I've been in contact with a TA, she's amazing and has been so helpful! We have our own budget (also terrifying) but I'm concerned what a good budget would be to set for my guests. I have a range from early 20s to late 60s and every type of income so I'm trying to figure out the best median number for my guests for 3 or 4 nights, any suggestions?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmillerick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464609188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmillerick","Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.196.6.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45555115b01e0986404ea731443bcebe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bmillerick\"] That&#039;s hard to answer for you, as only you know your guests, their likes\/dislikes (in terms of what they would want in a resort) and your best guess at what they can afford.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think what you will find is that you will be surprised at who comes and who doesn&#039;t, and what reasons they each have for their decisions. A lot of the time it is not related to money and, when it is, some of the people you least expected to make it work will be there, while the opposite will also hold true. Advice I&#039;ve seen here many times is be reasonable with your choices, but remember it&#039;s your wedding and you can&#039;t plan it around other people. You may end up disappointed if you do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914236,"PostDate":1465309345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> That's hard to answer for you, as only you know your guests, their likes\/dislikes (in terms of what they would want in a resort) and your best guess at what they can afford.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think what you will find is that you will be surprised at who comes and who doesn't, and what reasons they each have for their decisions. A lot of the time it is not related to money and, when it is, some of the people you least expected to make it work will be there, while the opposite will also hold true. Advice I've seen here many times is be reasonable with your choices, but remember it's your wedding and you can't plan it around other people. You may end up disappointed if you do.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab9dd4855ae6ad76199718a3853fbe4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"bmillerick\"] Welcome to the forums! Don&#039;t be shy to ask any and all your questions here, as there&#039;s always a plethora of us waiting to help answer them, or at least try to be of assistance guiding you down the right path for you, your fianc\u00e9 and your guests.\n\n\nDefinitely have several conversations with a good travel agent to help you figure out the location, before starting to feel overwhelmed with resort options. If most of your guests are travelling from the East, you might want to consider travel\/flight times, and stay on the Eastern side of things, such as the Riviera Maya in Mexico (along the Yucatan peninsula), where you will have plenty of resort options. There&#039;s also always the option of checking out Jamaica (Runaway Bay is where we&#039;ll be next week to photograph a wedding) or Montego Bay. There&#039;s also Punta Cana, D.R.\n\n\nCheck out locations and decide what sort of backdrop you want. Keep your options open, as you can choose a beach setting, gazebo, secluded bridge, gardens, or even on a catamaran if you so desire!\n\n\nI&#039;m including a handful of varying ceremonies we&#039;ve photographed here in the Riviera Maya as inspiration. Should you have any questions, feel free to ask us here, send a PM, or even send us a direct email. Just remember, planning your wedding should be fun, and be sure to enjoy it along the way.\n\n\nCheers!\n\nJasmin &amp;amp; Matt&amp;nbsp;\n\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35906,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_08.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-80973400-1465327400.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-80973400-1465327400_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200},{"Id":35912,"Name":"Melissa_Chris_Teaser_01.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-13826400-1465327692.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-13826400-1465327692_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":35908,"Name":"Jayme_Daren_Teaser_11.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-35219800-1465327464.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-35219800-1465327464_thumb.jpg","Width":799,"Height":1200},{"Id":35913,"Name":"Heather_Josue_Teaser_01.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-67260200-1465327810.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-67260200-1465327810_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35914,"Name":"Kristen_Michael_Teaser_12.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-64129900-1465327873.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-64129900-1465327873_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668}],"Id":1914240,"PostDate":1465313506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> Welcome to the forums! Don't be shy to ask any and all your questions here, as there's always a plethora of us waiting to help answer them, or at least try to be of assistance guiding you down the right path for you, your fianc\u00e9 and your guests.<br><br>\nDefinitely have several conversations with a good travel agent to help you figure out the location, before starting to feel overwhelmed with resort options. If most of your guests are travelling from the East, you might want to consider travel\/flight times, and stay on the Eastern side of things, such as the Riviera Maya in Mexico (along the Yucatan peninsula), where you will have plenty of resort options. There's also always the option of checking out Jamaica (Runaway Bay is where we'll be next week to photograph a wedding) or Montego Bay. There's also Punta Cana, D.R.<br><br>\nCheck out locations and decide what sort of backdrop you want. Keep your options open, as you can choose a beach setting, gazebo, secluded bridge, gardens, or even on a catamaran if you so desire!<br><br>\nI'm including a handful of varying ceremonies we've photographed here in the Riviera Maya as inspiration. Should you have any questions, feel free to ask us here, send a PM, or even send us a direct email. Just remember, planning your wedding should be fun, and be sure to enjoy it along the way.<br><br>\nCheers!<br>\nJasmin & Matt\u00a0<br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464781539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80111","Title":"Hello! And Help!","LastPostDate":1468629739},"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
