hese were great to use for rehearsal\/welcome dinners)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-99175000-1454377402.jpg\" title=\"20160201_193233.jpg -  104.95KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-99175000-1454377402.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_193233.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Wooden Chalkboard $10<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-64881600-1454377444.jpg\" title=\"20160201_192955.jpg -  69.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-64881600-1454377444.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_192955.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Chalkboard Mr & Mrs chair signs $20<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-44068800-1454377503.jpg\" title=\"20160201_193127.jpg -  106.36KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-44068800-1454377503.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_193127.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Black men's suspenders (ordered from Grunion Run - opened, but never worn) $10<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-14692500-1454377528.jpg\" title=\"20160201_193343.jpg -  93.37KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-14692500-1454377528.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_193343.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>38 tea lights - $20 (most of them weren't used at all. The one's that were used were only used for 6 hours)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-26854300-1454377564.jpg\" title=\"20160201_193739.jpg -  127KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-26854300-1454377564.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_193739.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>1 blush taffeta table drape (rectangle) 90\" x 156\" - Professionally dry cleaned \u00a0$15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-80814500-1454377623.jpg\" title=\"A86A4465.jpg -  69.6KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-80814500-1454377623.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"A86A4465.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>3 blush taffeta tabe cloths (circular) 132\" - Professionally dry cleaned \u00a0$50 for all 3<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-23877000-1454377763.jpg\" title=\"20160201_192939.jpg -  83.46KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-23877000-1454377763.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_192939.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-91435700-1454377984.jpg\" title=\"A86A4469.jpg -  70.64KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-91435700-1454377984.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"A86A4469.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>1 black and white striped table runner (used for head table) - professionally dry cleaned 16\" wide x 156\" long $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-75807400-1454378099.jpg\" title=\"HT8A4898.jpg -  94.85KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-75807400-1454378099.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"HT8A4898.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bride robe - Size M\/L - Never worn (tags still attached) $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-42666000-1454378118.jpg\" title=\"20150314_220120.jpg -  50.09KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-42666000-1454378118.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20150314_220120.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Gold Sequins bridal hanger - $10<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-25673400-1454378165.jpg\" title=\"20150602_155853.jpg -  190.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-25673400-1454378165.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20150602_155853.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-11307700-1454378188.jpg\" title=\"20150602_155907.jpg -  195.43KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-11307700-1454378188.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20150602_155907.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Card box (Paris) $10 - around 20 'advice for the bride and groom' cards included<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-61415600-1454378214.jpg\" title=\"20160201_194623.jpg -  100.67KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-61415600-1454378214.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_194623.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-94814400-1454378255.jpg\" title=\"20160201_194645.jpg -  66.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-94814400-1454378255.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_194645.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>7 packs of straws (each has 20 straws in it) -$15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-15376600-1454378282.jpg\" title=\"20160201_193452.jpg -  147.66KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-15376600-1454378282.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_193452.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>One layer tulle Ivory veil with a satin edge finish - Never worn $15 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"margin:0px\">White Single Tier 54\" Width 38\" Length Satin Ribbon Edge<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"margin:0px\"><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-34127000-1454379156.jpg\" title=\"il_570xN.384238344_b2wv.jpg -  82.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-34127000-1454379156.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"il_570xN.384238344_b2wv.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Flower crown - Custom made with silk florals off of Etsy (worn once for bachelorette)- $20<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-92613000-1454378420.jpg\" title=\"20160201_193045.jpg -  132.4KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-92613000-1454378420.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20160201_193045.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1910389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-30754400-1454378939.jpg\" title=\"flower crown.jpg -  46.28KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2016\/post-281478-0-30754400-1454378939.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"flower crown.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/